OL,3,AGuitar wars - the transatlantic battle
OL,4,Aover the Stratocaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FHans Thomann leads the way through his
OL,7,Fmusic store in central Germany to the
OL,8,Flarge electric guitar department, where
OL,9,Fthe walls are hung with hundreds of
OL,10,Finstruments.
OL,12,FBrands on show include famous names
OL,13,FFender and Gibson, plus Harley Benton.
OL,15,FThe latter is a low-price range of
OL,16,Fguitars owned by the family-run company
OL,17,Fthat Thomann leads ` Thomann, one of
OL,18,Fthe world's largest online retailers of
OL,19,Fmusical instruments.
